data: {"id": "77d0c747c4da4ad8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1639", "run_id": "77d0c747c4da4ad8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集证据与结论\n\n### 支持事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**: `phase=Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，`reason=ImagePullBackOff`。**Pod 未恢复**，仍处于 ImagePull 失败中。\n\n2. **镜像引用**: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，`imagePullPolicy=Always`，无 `imagePullSecrets`。\n\n3. **Events 核心错误**（kubectl_describe）:\n   > `failed to resolve reference \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789042833800, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "77d0c747c4da4ad8-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "77d0c747c4da4ad8", "seq": 1640, "ts_ms": 1789042840490, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 35.62, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/77d0c747c4da4ad8-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "81f19db33714366378db0402476c3a4a5cd0b7157bf26ea80d626c2434af26d3", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "773dbf355dd90072b3386a3f6c3b3bfecbf5224d7bf8da053a5b278bfabb18e5"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

